+### Staging DB: migrated on 2026-10-13 (VP-18481)
+
+Earlier versions of this section said the staging DBs were intentionally
+not migrated. That was true until 2026-10-13, when `storage_event_outbox`
+was created on `192.168.60.11:3306 / lis_inventory` (the DB both staging
+environments share) with `db/migrations/storage_event_outbox.sql`, so that
+LIS-transformer's staging deployment (`lis-trans-deployment-st`, which now
+hosts a copy of this outbox drainer behind `SAMPLE_CONSUMERS_ENABLED`) can
+drain against a real table and publish to the staging topic
+`storage-data-updates-staging`.
+
+Consequences for this service's staging pods:
+
+- `STORAGE_DATA_UPDATES_EMIT_ENABLED` stays `false` here, so this service
+  still never publishes from staging; the `P2021` fallback no longer
+  triggers because the table exists.
+- Staff actions on staging now insert outbox rows. Nothing in this service
+  drains them; LIS-transformer's staging drainer does, to the staging topic
+  only. The prod topic is unaffected.
 
